    {
      "id": "app-ie-disable",
      "title": "Disable Internet Explorer 11 (DISM)",
      "os": "windows",
      "script": "scripts/windows/ie-disable.ps1",
      "preambles": ["scripts/windows/_lib/require-admin.ps1"],
      "params": {},
      "expected_runtime_minutes": 5,
      "reboot_risk": "medium",
      "spotlight_match": {
        "vendor_pattern": "^Microsoft( Corporation)?$",
        "product_pattern": "^(Microsoft )?Internet Explorer"
      },
      "notes": "IE11 is retired (Microsoft 2022-06-15) with no patch path -- Spotlight's recommended remediation is removal via the optional-feature DISM disable. Runs `dism /online /Disable-Feature /FeatureName:Internet-Explorer-Optional-amd64 /NoRestart`; idempotent (no-ops when already Disabled). Reboot required to fully apply, after which the Spotlight finding clears."
